[10.007, "o", "$ verdict run-receipt \u001b[1m<\u001b[0m\u001b[1;95mtemporary\u001b[0m\u001b[39m offline run\u001b[0m\u001b[1m>\u001b[0m\r\nCOMPLETE: all implement/integrate nodes validated, barrier ok, review PASS\r\nintegrity: OK (events digest verified)\r\n  node-1             VALIDATED        alpha/claude-a[failure:rate_limited*] -> beta/gpt-b[success]\r\n  node-2             VALIDATED        alpha/claude-a[success]\r\n  integrate          VALIDATED        merge[success]\r\n  review: PASS by open-code-review offline-scenario on gamma/gemini-c\r\n\r\n$ verdict run-receipt <copy with one event byte changed>\r\n[expected exit 1: tamper detected if events_digest mismatch]\r\nCOMPLETE: all implement/integrate nodes validated, barrier ok, review PASS\r\nintegrity: events_digest mismatch: events.jsonl changed after receipt was written\r\n  node-1             VALIDATED        alpha/claude-a[failure:rate_limited*] -> beta/gpt-b[success]\r\n  node-2             VALIDATED        alpha/claude-a[success]\r\n  integrate          VALIDATED        merge[success]\r\n  review: PASS by open-code-review offline-scenario on gamma/gemini-c\r\n"]
